          "text": "The discrepancy metric (deception_gap) is defined in models/experiment.py and analysis/statistics.py as the signed percentage point difference between reported and actual progress: deception_gap = reported_progress - actual_progress. The verified campaign comprises 2,400 balanced observations across 600 execution clusters (seed 42 to 641), with unseeded pilot files excluded by design. Standard errors reflect cluster-robust standard errors (CRSE) grouped by execution seed."
